# HPS I/O standards and DDR3 settings, copied unchanged from the Terasic DE1-SoC GHRD rev E
# (de1_soc_GHRD .qsf), the same source as the HPS settings in #28. Not in the SRS. Only change:
# instance path u0| -> u_soc| (our arcade_soc instance name). HPS pins need no location
# assignment: they are fixed HPS pins. The GHRD's hps_reset source/probe IP is not used (B5).
